    "created_at": "2026-09-21T06:04:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-21T06:04:39Z",
    "body": "The H100 80GB/SM90 run (CUDA 13.0, PyTorch 2.13.0+cu130) covers the missing FP8 cases. [The base](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c191787a6861868069bc4f6ed6f842af541de23a) reproduces NaN/inf; [the tested head](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/a9cfe1e94cc22fc5fbe8aee357997855805b045d) passes the overflow regression and 576 FP8 controls with unchanged tests and separate Triton caches.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Raw GPU output excerpts</summary>\n\nBefore:\n```text\nE   AssertionError: tensor([ 0.9999, 48.2014, 50.0000, 50.0000,     nan,     nan, -0.9999,     nan,\nE                 inf], device='cuda:0')\n1 failed, 576 passed, 1302 deselected, 14 warnings in 67.74s (0:01:07)\n```\n\nAfter:\n```text\n577 passed, 1302 deselected, 14 warnings in 98.30s (0:01:38)\n```\n\nSaved GPU probe excerpt:\n```text\n\"finite\": true, \"max_absolute_error\": 1.1920928955078125e-06\n```\n</details>\n\nThis is kernel coverage, not a full serving run.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
